# The Monster Race Track trip back (MonsterRaceTrack) from a memo past int32 (2^32 and Trisha's
# id): the race manager (30995, a DerbyTrackManagerNpc) fails the parse, so the talk aborts before
# the trip and the memo stays (onTalk). Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/monster_race_track_return_past_int32.golden
character Gambler 20
memo MonsterRaceTrack_Npc 4294997355
script script.teleport.MonsterRaceTrack
page default/30995.htm
npc manager 30995 DerbyTrackManagerNpc 10 0 0

action manager
action manager
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=manager item=0 page=default/30995.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{manager}_Quest MonsterRaceTrack
  S ActionFailed
